<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Kannada strings of the iPhone UI. values/strings.xml has the comments for each key: where the text shows,
  the placeholders and the length limits. docs/LOCALIZATION_GLOSSARY.md gives the terms and their sources.
  The polite form "ನೀವು" with "-ಿ", and English loanwords where Kannada iOS uses them ("ಸೇವ್", "ಡಿಲೀಟ್", "ಎಡಿಟ್").
  Kannada has the CLDR plural forms one and other; "one" also takes 0, so each form keeps the number.
  The Export tab is "ವರದಿ" (report): "ಎಕ್ಸ್‌ಪೋರ್ಟ್" is longer than 10 characters. The duration chips have no unit; the captions name the hours.
-->
